   172|            <h1>Hospital Costs & Payment in China</h1>
   173|            <p class="subtitle">A complete financial guide covering pricing structures, payment methods, deposits, insurance reimbursement, and strategies to avoid unexpected medical bills.</p>
   174|            <div class="meta-info">
   175|                <span>&#x231A; 12 min read</span>
